      <h1 class="jr-h1">Plantar Fasciitis: What Actually Fixes Morning Heel Pain?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">The stabbing pain under your heel on the first few steps out of bed has a name, a mechanism and a short list of treatments with trial evidence behind them. It also has a long list of things sold for it that have never been tested, and an oral collagen supplement is one of them.</p>

